    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Requires Attunement</p><p><a href=\"https://amellwind-mh-dn-d5e-foundry-toolbox-2.vercel.app/weapons?weapon=Light+Bowgun\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Light Bowgun in the Toolbox</a></p><p>Ammo DC = 8 + your proficiency bonus + your Dexterity modifier</p><hr><h3>Features</h3><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Mastery (Slow)</strong></p><p>If you hit a creature with this weapon and deal damage to it, you can reduce its Speed by 10 feet until the start of your next turn. If the creature is hit more than once by weapons that have this property, the Speed reduction doesn't exceed 10 feet.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Rapid Fire</strong></p><p><strong>Bonus Action.</strong></p><p>When you take the Attack action and attack with this weapon, you can make one additional attack with it as a Bonus Action.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Overheat</strong></p><p>When you resolve an attack made with your Rapid Fire feature, you gain 1 stack of Overheat. Resolve that attack first (applying any Overheat stacks you already have), then gain the new stack; the attack that just granted the stack does not take that new stack's penalty.</p><p>While you have one or more stacks, attacks with this weapon deal 3 less damage for each stack (to a minimum of 1 damage from the weapon's damage roll and modifiers combined, before other effects that add damage dice). This penalty applies to every later attack with this weapon before the start of your next turn — including attacks from Action Surge, Extra Attack, and reactions — not only Rapid Fire shots. Overheat stacks last until the start of your next turn.</p><p>Against area ammunition (such as Pierce, Spread, or Explosive/Sticky Ammo), the penalty reduces the weapon damage of that shot for each creature affected. It does not change save DCs or non-damage effects (conditions, healing from Recover Ammo, and similar).</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Magazine</strong></p><p>The weapon holds a maximum of 6 loaded rounds at a time. When the magazine reaches 0, you must reload it before you can fire again.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Reload</strong></p><p><strong>Action.</strong></p><p>You can fully reload your magazine using an Action or a Bonus Action. When you do so, you choose the type of ammunition the weapon will contain.</p></div><h3>Ammunition</h3><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Normal Ammo</strong></p><p>Deals the weapon's base damage ([[/r 1d4]] Piercing) to a single target.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Pierce Ammo</strong></p><p>You fire in a 20-foot line that is 5 feet wide. Make a single attack roll and compare it against the AC of each creature in that line. All creatures hit take the weapon's normal damage.</p></div><div style=\"margin:0.65em 0;padding:0.55em 0.7em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Spread Ammo</strong></p><p>Instead of making an attack roll, you fire a 10-foot cone. Each creature in the cone must make a Dexterity saving throw against your Ammo DC. On a failed save, a creature takes [[/r 1d4]] Piercing damage.</p></div>",
      "chat": "<p>Requires Attunement</p><p>Ammo DC = 8 + your proficiency bonus + your Dexterity modifier</p><hr><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Mastery (Slow)</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Rapid Fire</strong></p><p><strong>Bonus Action.</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Overheat</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Magazine</strong></p></div><div style=\"margin:0.4em 0;padding:0.35em 0.55em;border-left:3px solid #c0c0c0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:0 4px 4px 0\"><p><strong style=\"color:#c0c0c0\">Reload</strong></p><p><strong>Action.</strong></p></div>"
    },
